<LegalPage
  title="Accessibility"
  description="Estrato's commitment to making this website usable by everyone."
  updated="October 2026"
>
  <p>
    Estrato wants everyone to be able to use this website, including people with disabilities. We are working to make the
    site easier to use and to follow the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA.
  </p>

  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Use semantic page structure, labeled form fields, and descriptive link and button text.</li>
    <li>Provide text alternatives for meaningful images.</li>
    <li>Support keyboard navigation and visible focus states.</li>
    <li>Keep text readable with strong color contrast and layouts that adapt from phones to large screens.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Known limitations</h2>
  <p>
    Some parts of the site are provided by third parties, including the shopping cart and checkout (Bottle Nexus) and the
    email sign-up form (Klaviyo). We cannot fully control their accessibility, but we work with these providers and raise
    issues where we find them. Some decorative or video content may not yet have full alternatives.
  </p>

  <h2>Tell us about a problem</h2>
  <p>
    If you have trouble using any part of the site, or need information in another format, please let us know through our
    <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. Describe the page and the problem, and we will do our best to help and to fix it.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
